<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 30.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	19.41     2.37</p>
<p> 2   Central Norseman    14.06     0.96</p>
<p> 3   Telecasters Nqld    13.33     5.25</p>
<p> 4   Pac Mutal Aust	12.71     2.36</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	10.56     1.42</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr     10.32     0.95</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv     10.31     0.99</p>
<p> 8   Indu Property	 10.11     0.90</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	  9.95     1.64</p>
<p>10   Gem Property Tr	9.73     1.44</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	9.71     1.09</p>
<p>12   Multistack	     9.68     0.31</p>
<p>13   Villa World	    9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14   OLS Asia Hldgs	 9.48     0.77</p>
<p>15   Blackmores Lab	 9.28     3.45</p>
